===============================================================
   |   solving M=32 ...
   |   solving M=64 ...
   |   solving M=128 ...
   |   solving M=256 ...
   | 
   |  tile height    raw err%   col-calib%    col+row%
   | -------------------------------------------------
   |           32      57.712      35.8956     14.0611
   |           64      70.080      40.6097     17.7312
   |          128      87.815      55.8750     47.4445
   |          256      91.563      62.8410     68.6505
   | -------------------------------------------------
   | 
   | INTERPRETATION
   |   raw err%    mesh solve against ideal, no correction
   |   col-calib%  the project's per-column constant only
   |   col+row%    plus a per-row gain FITTED on one activation pattern
   |               and applied to unseen ones
   | 
   |   If col+row is far below col, the wordline error is largely a
   |   compile-time constant and the contribution survives intact.
   |   If col+row stays close to col, the residual is activation-
   |   dependent and the claim must be narrowed to the bitline term.
   | 
